  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Golden light climbs over the fence.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "A quiet farm day starts to stir.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "By the barn, A finds Apple. It is a plant food that grows from a crop, vine, shrub, or tree before it is picked.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B — Barn. A barn is a farm building that can shelter animals, hay, tools, or supplies.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "What waits at C? Chicken! Perch, then fly | quick wingbeats cross the sky",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D is for Duck. A duck paddles on top of the water and dips its beak below.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Ewe — our E. Step by step | sturdy legs keep moving yet",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "By the barn, F finds Farmer. A farmer cares for crops, animals, land, and the daily work of a farm.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G — Grain. Grain is the small seed harvested from crops such as wheat, oats, or corn.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "What waits at H? Hen! It is an adult female chicken that can lay eggs.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I is for Irrigation Pump. An irrigation pump moves water through pipes or hoses so crops can be watered.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Jug — our J. It is a container with a handle and a narrow opening for pouring liquid.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "By the barn, K finds Kid Goat. Step by step | sturdy legs keep moving yet",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L — Lamb. A lamb is a young sheep with a soft woolly coat and small hooves.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Sun comes up—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Country words wake up with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "What waits at M? Milk! It is a pale liquid food produced by mammals; on farms it is commonly collected from dairy animals.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N is for Nest. A nest is a place birds build to hold eggs and chicks.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Ox — our O. Hooves go slow | sure-foot steps along below",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "By the barn, P finds Pig. It has a strong snout for rooting and a stout body carried on four hooved feet.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q — Quilt. Stitch by stitch | warm layered fabric, soft and rich",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "What waits at R? Rooster! It is an adult male chicken with a noticeable comb and a loud crow.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S is for Sheep. Hooves on ground | steady little steps go round",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Trough — our T. It is a long open container that can hold feed or water for farm animals.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "By the barn, U finds Udder. It is the milk-producing organ beneath animals such as cows, goats, and sheep.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V — Vet Kit. A vet kit holds simple tools a veterinarian uses to check animal health.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "What waits at W? Wagon! Wagon on the way | four wheels carry things today",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X is for X-ray Vet Image. An X-ray vet image lets a veterinarian see bones inside an animal without opening the body.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Sun comes up—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Country words wake up with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Yam — our Y. It stores food in a thick underground tuber.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "By the barn, Z finds Zebu. It is a type of cattle with a noticeable hump over its shoulders.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Soft cue, A ... Apple! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "B? ... Barn! Make a roof shape with both hands.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Show C ... Chicken! Lift two gentle wings, then hold still.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Remember D ... Duck! Paddle both hands gently.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Soft cue, E ... Ewe! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "F? ... Farmer! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Show G ... Grain! Pinch two fingers like a tiny grain.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Remember H ... Hen! Lift two gentle wings, then hold still.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Soft cue, I ... Irrigation Pump! Point to the picture and name its job.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "J? ... Jug! Mime one gentle pouring motion.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Show K ... Kid Goat! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Remember L ... Lamb! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Soft cue, M ... Milk! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "N? ... Nest! Cup both hands like a nest.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Show O ... Ox! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Remember P ... Pig! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Sun comes up—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Country words wake up with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Soft cue, Q ... Quilt! Mime pulling a warm quilt up gently.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "R? ... Rooster! Lift two gentle wings, then hold still.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Show S ... Sheep! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Remember T ... Trough! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Soft cue, U ... Udder! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "V? ... Vet Kit! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Show W ... Wagon! Roll two hands forward like wagon wheels.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Remember X ... X-ray Vet Image! Point to the picture and name its job.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Soft cue, Y ... Yam! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Z? ... Zebu! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
